


>> CoffeeMachine := 객체 새로.
CoffeeMachine 받으면: ['order:'] 실행: { :id
	>> coffee := ['Americano'].
	( id = 1 ) 참이면: {
		coffee := ['Cappuccino'].
	}.
	( id = 2 ) 참이면: {
		coffee := ['Espresso'].
	}.
	( id = 3 ) 참이면: {
		coffee := ['Latte'].
	}. <- coffee.
}.
>> SimpleCoffeeMachine := 객체 새로.
SimpleCoffeeMachine 받으면: ['order'] 실행: { <- ['Black']. }.
>> redCup := CoffeeMachine order: 1.
출력 쓰기: redCup, 줄바꿈.
redCup := ['Tea']. 
>> greenCup := CoffeeMachine order: 0.
출력 쓰기: greenCup, 줄바꿈.
>> yellowCup := CoffeeMachine order: 1.
출력 쓰기: yellowCup, 줄바꿈.
>> blueCup := CoffeeMachine order: 0.
출력 쓰기: blueCup, 줄바꿈.
>> plasticCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
plasticCup := ['Lemonade']. 
>> blackCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
출력 쓰기: blackCup, 줄바꿈.
blackCup 뒤에추가: [' nooo.... beer. '].
>> orangeCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
출력 쓰기: orangeCup, 줄바꿈.
